# Mined from the user's own local Claude Code transcripts. The repo is public; this file
# never leaves the machine and is never committed. Regenerate with `bun mine-corpus.ts`.
corpus.json

# Node modules for the harness (mermaid + a highlighter), installed locally by `bun install`.
node_modules/
bundle.js

# An `?arms=async` run posts here instead of results.json, so a partial sweep never overwrites
# the committed one. It is scratch: the doc quotes results.json.
results-async.json
